OL,3,AGCSE pass rate falls slightly as top
OL,4,Agrades edge up across England, Wales
OL,5,Aand Northern Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt one school in Derby, it's confetti,
OL,8,Fcheers and happy tears as students
OL,9,Freceive their results, while
OL,10,F16-year-old Sophie "can't believe"
OL,11,Fshe's passed her English language exam
OL,13,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,14,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,15,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,16,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,18,FStudents in Scotland have already
OL,19,Freceived their results, with the pass
OL,20,Frate up slightly on last year
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
